  "source": "docs/design/KATANA_DESIGN_PLAN.md sections b, c, d, e and l, with the owner decisions in docs/design/KATANA_REDESIGN_PLAN.md section 14.7 (red is the primary action), and the mixed-plan additions marked in the note on each pair.",
  "note": "Keys match the CSS custom properties without the leading --. Dark is the default; light applies under [data-theme=\"light\"]. accent-red is one role with two values, tuned so each passes contrast on its theme's page. on-accent is the label colour on a red fill (bg-base in each theme). Status is a dot and a word, never a tinted fill, so there are no -soft tokens.",
